# L §6.1 Shared law: "Two members that copy different versions of one law part (identified by the part's id and the
# versions it holds, never by equal names) are refused (LOAD-SAME) unless the joint model states, by a same line,
# which one both follow." A's copy of law part pit holds pit_2025 and pit_2026, C's only pit_2025.
=== J/joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "../A" sha256 "ef1255868d73b8e3d5a759552f9e27aea1289c330c913ceff9e3d289c522459a"
  use c = "../C" sha256 "eb365491d24abf193947ef44eaccf6c5c4e448676ad35a1cfc66907bca4f0f2a"

ask r: a.rate
=== A/reality.tally
model ma
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
=== A/law/pit.tally
part pit
  tally 2
  law

source act "ustawa"

input rate: num

version pit_2025
  cite act
  governs 2025-01-01..
  known 2024-12-01
  rate = 0.12 "art. 1"

version pit_2026
  cite act
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2025-12-01
  replace rate = 0.10 "art. 1"
=== C/reality.tally
model mc
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
=== C/law/pit.tally
part pit
  tally 2
  law

source act "ustawa"

input rate: num

version pit_2025
  cite act
  governs 2025-01-01..
  known 2024-12-01
  rate = 0.12 "art. 1"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-SAME members a and c copy different versions of law part pit
